LL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690386115_muka_Nov.jpg',10734,'2023-07-26 15:43:23','2023-07-26 15:43:23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dari penampilan biasa aja, seadanya, males ajasi, hehe. (Skincare, makeup, ada, tapi dipakenya ntah, haha, semaunya aja).\r\nBisa diandalkan, biasa dianggap bisa/lebih sama orang, jadi tuntutan lebih baik karena itu.\r\n\r\n\r\nGak suka dikritik 😁 ngasitaunya tuh harus woles gitu, gabisa dikasarin.\r\n\r\nCare banget, BANGET, secare itu sama orang apalagi yg disayang.\r\n\r\nBucin? suka banget sama orang yg tipeku banget, huhu. Ngebanggain gitu, memuji 🥺 (dalam hati).\r\n\r\nKalo deket sama aku gak sediem itu, ada aja kelakuan tingkahnya. Random sih.\r\n\r\nYg baru kenal keliat diem, jutek, anti sosial.\r\nAku males sama orang yg sok sih yg gak ramah, ya udah bodo amat, hehe, cuek.\r\n\r\nKerja ya kerja aja, gak noleh kanan kiri, selesai. Kalo di luar kerjaan ya bebas.\r\n\r\nBisa ngerame, ya nyerocos, gak dilucu²in (menurutku suaraku kek manja² padahal ya engga, jelek), ekspresi kek lebay, jadi jijik sendiri, kok gitu bentukannya.\r\n\r\nGak ngerasa cantik sih. Ngerasa gak pantes aja dandan² kek sama aja (emang gabisa dandan aja gaksi), belajar lebih cewe, hehe.'),(281,'Trisya','trisyaanjar@gmail.com','0858880803276','10/21/1994',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690621101_muka_Trisya.jpg',10752,'2023-07-29 09:03:30','2023-07-29 09:03:30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(282,'Clara','ct_clara@yahoo.com','081377707712','10/12/1999',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PR & Event Specialist','Sudah bekerja selama 3 bulan, baru selesai probation dan naik ke full time',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690643967_sisi_samping_Clara.jpg','1690643967_telapak_jari_Clara.jpg','1690643967_telapak_close_Clara.jpg','1690643967_muka_Clara.jpg',10756,'2023-07-29 15:49:20','2023-07-29 15:49:20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(283,'stella','wangsastella@gmail.com','085156756681','01/06/2002',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690721104_muka_stella.jpg',10764,'2023-07-30 12:48:20','2023-07-30 12:48:20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'kind of introverted but not really, i can be extroverted when i need to tapi it\'s kind of tiring tbh 😃 i have a really weird sense of humor, joke around often with my friends, i laugh very easily. not very open with other people, i like to handle my problems independently'),(284,'Lea Anupraba','leaanuprabha5@gmail.com','082132954455','07/10/2000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690777015_muka_Lea Anupraba.jpg',10767,'2023-07-31 04:29:59','2023-07-31 04:29:59',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pemarah dan galak, moody, super self-conscious/insecure most days, social anxiety dan introvert, awkward, talks a lot instead of listening, pemendam. Care too much for other people rather than myself, always smiling tapi sering dikata judes, suka menolong, empathetic.'),(285,'Ariane Rosa Malada','arinrosa@gmail.com','61490895576','10/13/1999',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1690815749_muka_Ariane Rosa Malada.jpg',10805,'2023-07-31 15:10:50','2023-07-31 15:10:50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aku orangnya sangat takutan dan gampang kepikiran omongan orang lain, ga pede selalu ngerasa insecure soal pengetahuan dan kemampuan, plin plan, socially awkward :( tapi aku orangnya gampang berteman juga(?) selalu coba jd problem solver dan ngasih yg terbaik buat orang terdekat'),(286,'Christi isabella','christy.bella98@gmail.comx','+62 895 337339800','05/29/1998',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Single selama 4 tahun','straight','Sebenernya agak susah terbuka sm org baru selama 4 tahun ini. Baru kali ini aku interest sm orang, eh org itu diem2 interest jg sama aku hehe tp masalahnya jarakumur kita berdua lumayan jauh sekitar 17thn an. Aku baru mau kenal lebih jauh beberapa minggu ini, karena dia bikin nyaman dan sopan. Tp beberapa hr ini muncul pikiran, bakal dibawa kemana ini hubungan hehe apakah jd temen aja atau lanjut jd pasangan. Makin kesini pikiran jd bimbang dengan sendiri nya','1690829603_sisi_samping_Christy.jpg','1690829603_telapak_jari_Christy.jpg','1690829603_telapak_close_Christy.jpg','1690829603_muka_Christy.jpg',10816,'2023-07-31 19:02:18','2023-07-31 19:07:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(288,'Kevin Liang','kevinliang077@gmail.com','081369096736','10/07/1998',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'single 7 tahun','straight','kalo pacaran gaperna lama paling lama 3 bulan, kalo deketin orang selalu dikacangin / ujung\"nya dighosting, mudah ilfeel sm cwek','1690907521_sisi_samping_Kevin Liang.jpg','1690907521_telapak_jari_Kevin Liang.jpg','1690907521_telapak_close_Kevin Liang.jpg','1690907521_muka_Kevin Liang.jpg',10875,'2023-08-01 16:41:42','2023-08-01 16:41:42',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(289,'Ng Devy Winardi','devywinardi@gmail.com','082188071668','12/14/1999',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691001233_muka_Ng Devy Winardi.jpg',10903,'2023-08-02 18:37:47','2023-08-02 18:37:47',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sulit untuk lebih terbuka dengan orang\"'),(290,'Maria Giovani Isalaura','mariagiovaniisalaura@gmail.com','081275288009','05/27/1989',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691065406_muka_Maria Giovani Isalaura.jpg',10909,'2023-08-03 12:29:22','2023-08-03 12:29:22',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'60% extrovert, 40% introvert. Suka meet up dengan teman2, suka sekali membaca & nonton lectures. Suka team work & hates politics / competition. Sangat tidak suka di provokasi tp saya org nya fair'),(291,'Rivana','jrivana001@gmail.com','082166218821','12/10/1994',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Brand Platform Manager','Sudah kerja selama 4.5tahun',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691119363_sisi_samping_Rivana.jpg','1691119363_telapak_jari_Rivana.jpg','1691119363_telapak_close_Rivana.jpg','1691119363_muka_Rivana.jpg',10914,'2023-08-04 03:32:30','2023-08-04 03:32:30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Introvert, insecure and shy, overthinker, optimis, disiplin, mudah beradaptasi, keras kepala, plin plan.'),(292,'Helena Benedicta','helenabenedicta1992@gmail.com','081220868650','10/15/1992',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691165984_muka_Helena Benedicta.jpg',10923,'2023-08-04 16:32:43','2023-08-04 16:32:43',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'supel, cerewet, ceria, blak blakan, agak sembarangan'),(293,'LADV Tattoos','ladvtattoos@gmail.com','0877-6154-0001','12/18/1986',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691423177_muka_LADV Tattoos.jpg',10947,'2023-08-07 16:25:57','2023-08-07 16:26:09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aku suka berstrategi dan merancang hal-hal. Ngebicarain hal lebih dalem dari keseharian hidup kaya ide apa yang bisa dilakuin buat survive atau tackling climate change misalnya (tp kynya g mungkin), filosofi Stoic, atau manifesto seniman. Super passionate creating artworks dan kepo sama segala jenis craftmanship, pengen bisa segalanyahhh atau seengganya nyobain. Goal-oriented & workaholic ‘cause I enjoy it and I wish to always better my works. Kayanya ace-aro ‘cause two is a crowd hehe. I don’t act like the kindest but when I do it, it’s sincere, I appreciate long-lasting and meaningful relationships- I don’t have much friends (people may say I’m so private) but I’m grateful to have someone I can call my bestfriend.'),(294,'sasha','sashanabila2209@gmail.com','087773590711','09/22/1996',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691429514_muka_sasha.jpg',10949,'2023-08-07 17:34:38','2023-08-07 17:34:38',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'heartfelt\r\ngoofy'),(295,'Meiriyana Lim','meiriylim@gmail.com','087819104679','05/29/1991',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691462787_muka_Meiriyana Lim.jpg',10950,'2023-08-08 02:48:42','2023-08-08 02:49:29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ga jelas, moody, keras kepala, emosi'),(296,'Yuana','yuana.rimba@yahoo.com','081258590109','03/04/1996',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691501187_muka_Yuana.jpg',10958,'2023-08-08 13:27:04','2023-08-08 13:27:04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(297,'Natasha','natashaisinambela@gmail.com','0813-3985-6724','12/09/1996',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691501032_muka_Natasha.jpg',10957,'2023-08-08 13:40:57','2023-08-08 13:40:57',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'- ambivert, seneng belajar hal baru, penasaran tinggi, lumayan kritis, cukup berani dan mudah adaptasi, overthinking'),(298,'Sarah Mursjid','ramadhaniasarah@gmail.com','+6287788383222','12/31/1997',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1691502161_muka_Sarah Mursjid.jpg',10961,'2023-08-08 13:55:08','2023-08-08 13:55:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'I would say aku anaknya lumayan extroverted (although leaning towards introvert), I love meeting new people and spending quality time with old friends. Tapi aku lumayan selective when it comes to new people sebetulnya. Meskipun suka ketemu orang-orang baru, I have my guard up quite a bit and I don\'t easily share myself/my stories. I\'m also a curious and open-minded person, aku anaknya suka belajar hal-hal baru dan kalau ketemu sesuatu hal yg lagi disukain bisa mendalam bgt research nya. I\'m quite introspective, I spend a lot of time thinking and trying to understand my thoughts and feelings. I love learning about psychology and human behavior. Weakness nya kadang aku bisa overthinking terus take things too personally. Dan kalo overthinking nya lagi parah, I can become my own worst critic. Also, lumayan agak gampang ke distract kalo lagi kerja, susah fokus.'),(299,'jessica','lieblxng@gmail.com','081288881199','08/15/1998','Kb. Jeruk, Kec. Kb. Jeruk, Kota Jakarta Barat, Daerah Khusus Ibukota Jakarta 11530',NULL,'06:00',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,10970,'2023-08-09 06:58:23','2023-08-09 06:58:23','Karang Mulya, Karang Tengah, Tangerang, Banten 15157',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(300,'Sally Mulatsih','sallymulatsih@gmail.com','0811185433','07/21/1973',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,