y person (thats why i always got involved with shitty man. i think everyone are good but fr some people are beyond help) but also a haters, im hateful and also like to talk shit about people💀 and softies who cries a lot and im also the toughest person in the world. im literally so strong (but still cry a lot)\r\n i would be the one who makes the biggest effort to maintain friendship and also would be the one who cut off first (if u dont do the same😭).\r\nim a procrastinator that do things h-1 deadline and also a hardworker that want to achieve peacefulness by doing shits 5 days ahead before deadline.\r\ni am introverted and shy and i love attention. i wanna be the center of attention! i want everyone to look at me while im still being reserved and calm.\r\ni want to be alone at times and i also love companies. i trust people too much because i believe they are good and wont do anything to me and i also struggled in trusting people because i would be suspicious of their every behavior so i cant let people in.\r\n i believe that my personality are so fluid and im open to be whatever i want to achieve. so what makes me myself? everything that happens, influence me wouldnt make me less, it\'ll make me more. i\'ve built myself in a certain way for 24 years that have shaped my thought process, my values that built within years of character development, now that i have self awareness, is what making me myself.'),(413,'Nanik','Yossysoblessed@gmail.com','81233561556','05/01/1985','Pati 59117',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1698999901_muka_Nanik.jpg',11873,'2023-11-03 08:29:09','2023-11-03 08:29:09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(414,'William Christian Solihin','williamcsolihin@gmail.com','081290600252','05/14/1998',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Associate','Sudag kerja selama 28 bulan',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1699030647_sisi_samping_William Solihin.jpg','1699030647_telapak_jari_William Solihin.jpg','1699030647_telapak_close_William Solihin.jpg','1699030647_muka_